    "description": "Starts an HTTP server for this database that runs SQL sent in GET/POST requests and returns JSONEachRow, JSONCompact, CSV or XML. Port 0 picks a free port. auth is an X-API-Key value, or user:password for HTTP Basic auth; an empty auth is only allowed on loopback addresses unless httpserver_allow_unauthenticated_remote is set. Refused when enable_external_access is false.",
